# ── Local / regenerable ──────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.whl
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.DS_Store
._*

# ── Anchored on purpose — do not un-anchor these ─────────────────────
# An unanchored `models/` in the previous iteration silently swallowed
# engine/python/sglang/srt/models/ — 298 source files, 836 files total —
# and left a repo that could not import the engine it was supposed to
# contain. Rule: every directory rule here is anchored to the repo root.
# Never write a bare directory name in this file.
/models/
/third_party/
/build/
/dist/

# ── Never ignore build inputs ────────────────────────────────────────
# A bare `*.mod` once matched go.mod. Do not add extension-wide rules.
